setIrm.tree
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with Ownable: caller is not the owner
└── when caller is owner
    ├── it should call _accrueInterest first
    ├── it should set irm to new address
    ├── when new irm is zero address
    │   └── it should not call IIrm.setMarket
    └── when new irm is not zero address
        └── it should call IIrm.setMarket with contract address 